OL,3,GNEWSADefibrillator installed after
OL,4,Afatal cardiac arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family whose son died from a cardiac
OL,7,Farrest have said they hope a new
OL,8,Fdefibrillator installed in his memory
OL,9,Fwill "give someone the chance he didn't
OL,10,Fhave".
OL,12,FAfter Sam Polledri died aged 24 in
OL,13,FBristol in 2022, his family set up a
OL,14,Ffoundation to save others.
OL,16,FAn automated external defibrillator
OL,17,F(AED) was unveiled at Dundry View in
OL,18,FHengrove by the Great Western Air
OL,19,FAmbulance Charity (GWAAC) and the Sam
OL,20,FPolledri Foundation, which has helped
OL,21,Ffund more than 90 other devices.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
