OL,3,GNEWSADefibrillator installed after
OL,4,Afatal cardiac arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam's mother Louise Polledri said
OL,7,Flosing her son was "devastating", which
OL,8,Fwas made even harder knowing "there
OL,9,Fwere defibrillators close to where he
OL,10,Fcollapsed, but they weren't accessible
OL,11,Fto the public".
